Description: NexusOS installer configuration (Calamares)
 Calamares settings and branding for installing NexusOS Engineering Edition
 from the live image: NexusOS slides and colours, erase-disk installs with
 optional LUKS2 encryption, a "Default layout" for
 manual partitioning (standard, or LVM prepared by nexusos-lvm-layout), the first account created as the administrator
 (sudo group), Plasma on Wayland with SDDM, Ubuntu's signed boot chain, and
 removal of the installer and live-session tools from the installed system.
 .
 Live session only: an "Install NexusOS" launcher and desktop icon. The
 launcher refuses to run outside the live session (boot=casper).
